        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baali mu Galilaaya Yesu yaabakoba ati: “Omwana w'Omuntu aja kugheebwayo mu mikono egy'abantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.22",
